WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t2-07-projection-clarity.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:05.390
Something set you off and the size of it didn't match.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.600
You probably noticed at the time a small thing

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:12.970
A very large reaction and some part of you go and hang on

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:24.610
Nothing here says you were wrong about what happened. It might have been
genuinely annoying.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:30.020
We're interested in the gap between the event and the size. The body goes
first.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:38.920
The part of you that knows how to handle this comes second. It's slower, but
it's there. Most of the trouble lives in the gap between the two.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:57.380
The next few minutes, close some of it. You don't need to keep track. I'll
take you through them.

phase-recognise
00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:10.420
First we recognise where this spike lives in your flesh. Heat, usually. Face,
chest,

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.000
Something fast.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:28.100
The particular quality of being very certain very quickly, described it in one
word, agitated, and noticed what got left out.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:32.680
Then, the thing they did, whether they should have.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.730
Here's what you just did though

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:43.340
You described the state and something in you did the describing

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.860
Those aren't the same thing and it's the second one we're using for the next
few minutes

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.630
Now go one step deeper.

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.250
Your body recognized it before you did.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.850
And it's answering something older than this.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.140
The fear of being made small.

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:30.610
Of being found at fault or having your boundaries trampled.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:40.430
Leave that realization right where it is. Nothing to solve here.

phase-regulate
00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.540
We regulate your physiology to cool the heat.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:03:03.770
Breathe in for four and out for six. Longer out than in every time.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:20.110
Bring your attention to the middle of your chest. Thoughts will come. Maybe a
lot of them.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:22.970
That's what a mind does

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.550
And it doesn't mean this isn't working.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:36.275
When one arrives, let it arrive. Don't push it away. Don't follow it. Don't
finish it. A thought turning up isn't a thought asking you to act. If you

00:03:36.275 --> 00:03:39.510
notice yourself working hard at this, ease off.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:52.040
Watching takes no effort. Effort means you've started fighting.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.990
Whether passes through a room.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:07.510
The room doesn't become the weather. Stay here a little longer. This is the
part people cut short. Resting and the quiet before we move forward.

phase-release
00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:23.310
Third, we release the compulsion to place the blame on them. There are two
separate things going on. There's the reaction, which is real and is in your

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:24.200
body right now.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:30.120
And there's where you put it on them on what they're like, what they always
do, what kind of person does that.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.680
That move is fast.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:42.690
And it feels like clarity and it has one reliable feature it never reduces
anything the reaction stays exactly where it was

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.300
And now there's a person attached to it.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.180
So put down the placing

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:55.720
Keep the reaction.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.690
It's yours

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:15.350
And its information. Take a dedicated moment to extend genuine gratitude to
your heart.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:28.030
And your inner focus for setting a light on what was really driving this
reaction from within.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:45.670
The underlying concern that your truth and personal dignity were under attack
was completely real to your system and maintaining that defensive posture

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:49.590
In the background has been continuously draining your energy.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:06:00.070
Thank that protective mechanism for standing up for you and let it know it can
rest its guard now and the useful question here isn't what's wrong with them.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.580
It isn't what's wrong with me either.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.980
What was this for?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:09.300
When a reaction outruns the event, the extra is carrying something.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.510
Not necessarily about the person in front of you.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.080
That's a way of looking instead of a fact.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.600
And what it shows you is yours to read.

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.330
So the gap

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.160
The part that was bigger than the occasion.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.070
What's it actually about?

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:28.380
Nobody outside this can tell you what it is.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.980
Leave the question alone for now.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.830
If something arrived,

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.040
Let it sit.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.850
If nothing did,

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.420
That's ordinary.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.950
This one usually comes in its own time and rarely on demand.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.740
You don't need the answer now.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:45.370
Keep the question.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:48.330
Put the original fear where your breath is.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.210
If it was being the problem.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:51.900
Don't test it now.

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.320
Picking at it from inside this state

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:55.890
Only makes it louder

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.290
Leave it where it is

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.290
None of it gets settled from inside this state.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:09.090
That's why it waits until you're out

phase-rise
00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:19.610
Fourth, we rise into clear, self-reflective.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.910
Perspective.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.510
Picture yourself from across the room.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:33.030
Someone who overreacted and noticed.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.590
Something in that was about you.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.210
That's a finding.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.260
Not a fault.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:42.510
Now picture the version of you that you want to be the next time

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.040
Something lands bigger than it should.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.420
Same spike.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.060
Same certainty.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:58.450
But you're the one deciding where your attention goes.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.120
Not on the conclusion.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.100
On the pause before it.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.060
What do you ask instead of assume?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.490
What do you say?

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:07.740
Maybe.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.400
That landed bigger than it should have.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.010
Now step into it.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.110
The reaction is still there.

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:22.380
Your attention is where you put it.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.610
Pick one thing you'll do this way in the moment.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:32.820
Next time

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.370
Not afterwards.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.320
Once that moment has happened,

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:37.680
Look back at it.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.700
And write down what was different.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.720
One more slow breath.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.180
In for four.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.110
Different or not.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.370
Move your hands and feet.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.170
Open your eyes when you're ready.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:32.780
Return to this guided meditation as often as you need to until you no longer
do.
